  ('apple-cinnamon-overnight-oats', 'Apple Cinnamon Overnight Oats', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 480, true, 'Oats soaked overnight with milk, yogurt, diced apple and cinnamon for four grab-and-go breakfasts.', array['Stir the oats, milk, yogurt, maple syrup, cinnamon and salt together in a bowl.', 'Fold in most of the diced apple.', 'Divide among four jars or containers and top with the remaining apple.', 'Cover and refrigerate overnight, or up to 4 days.', 'Eat cold, or microwave 1 minute to warm through.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548427049-97fe7f296a1c', 'Naghme Kn', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/chocolate-in-clear-glass-jar-near-apple-slices-hyWqGawZ0zI', true),
  ('avocado-toast-with-fried-eggs', 'Avocado Toast with Fried Eggs', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian']::text[], 2, 10, false, 'Toasted whole wheat bread piled with lemony mashed avocado and a fried egg on each slice.', array['Toast the bread.', 'Mash the avocados with the lemon juice and salt.', 'Melt the butter in a skillet over medium heat and fry the eggs 3 minutes, until the whites are set.', 'Spread the avocado on the toast and top each slice with an egg.', 'Finish with black pepper and red pepper flakes.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1525351484163-7529414344d8', 'Ben Kolde', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/bread-with-sunny-side-up-egg-served-on-white-ceramic-plate-FFqNATH27EM', true),
  ('bacon-and-egg-spaghetti-with-peas', 'Bacon and Egg Spaghetti with Peas', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Spaghetti in a silky egg and parmesan sauce with crisp bacon, garlic and sweet peas.', array['Boil the spaghetti in salted water until al dente, adding the peas for the last minute.', 'Meanwhile, cook the chopped bacon in a large skillet until crisp, then stir in the garlic.', 'Whisk the eggs with the parmesan and pepper in a bowl.', 'Drain the pasta, saving 1/2 cup of the pasta water, and toss it in the skillet over low heat.', 'Pour in the egg mixture and toss constantly for 1 to 2 minutes, loosening with pasta water, until the sauce thickens.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612548041504-659189a63246', 'logan jeffrey', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/pasta-dish-on-white-ceramic-plate-Ky12Qu8fKzM', true),
  ('bacon-eggs-and-avocado-plates', 'Bacon, Eggs and Avocado Plates', 'breakfast', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 2, 15, false, 'A classic low-carb plate of crisp bacon, eggs fried in butter and sliced avocado.', array['Lay the bacon in a cold skillet and cook over medium heat 8 minutes, turning, until crisp; drain on paper towels.', 'Pour off most of the fat, add the butter and fry the eggs 3 minutes, until the whites are set.', 'Slice the avocado.', 'Plate the eggs with the bacon and avocado and season with salt and pepper.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608475861994-cf7af0f0c1be', 'James Kern', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/fried-egg-on-black-pan-aLDW0oQ0NtU', true),
  ('baked-chicken-parmesan-with-spaghetti', 'Baked Chicken Parmesan with Spaghetti', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, false, 'Crispy oven-baked breaded chicken topped with marinara and melted mozzarella over spaghetti.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F and oil a sheet pan.', 'Halve the chicken breasts horizontally into 4 cutlets.', 'Dip each cutlet in the beaten egg, then coat in the breadcrumbs mixed with the parmesan, Italian seasoning and salt.', 'Drizzle with the remaining oil and bake 18 minutes, flipping once.', 'Top each cutlet with a spoonful of marinara and the mozzarella and bake 5 more minutes.', 'Boil the spaghetti, toss it with the remaining warmed marinara and serve with the chicken.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1632778149955-e80f8ceca2e8', 'Clark Douglas', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-with-meat-and-broccoli-HhEfe0DeMiA', true),
  ('beef-and-broccoli-ramen-stir-fry', 'Beef and Broccoli Ramen Stir-Fry', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Ground beef, broccoli and ramen noodles tossed in a sweet garlic soy sauce.', array['Boil the ramen noodles for 3 minutes without the seasoning packets, then drain.', 'Whisk the soy sauce, brown sugar, cornstarch, ground ginger and 1/2 cup water.', 'Brown the ground beef in a large skillet over medium-high heat for 6 minutes, then drain the fat.', 'Add the garlic and frozen broccoli, cover and cook 4 minutes.', 'Pour in the sauce and simmer 2 minutes until it thickens.', 'Toss in the noodles, sesame oil and green onions.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1666613710166-91a0cb67fad9', 'Batkhuyag Enkhtuvshin', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-gdDzQXTyqcE', true),
  ('beef-stew-with-potatoes-and-carrots', 'Beef Stew with Potatoes and Carrots', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 120, true, 'Slow-simmered beef with potatoes, carrots, celery and peas in a rich thyme and tomato gravy.', array['Toss the beef with the flour, salt and pepper, then brown it in the oil in a large pot for 6 minutes.', 'Add the onion, celery and garlic and cook 4 minutes, then stir in the tomato paste.', 'Pour in the broth and Worcestershire, add the thyme and simmer, covered, for 1 hour.', 'Add the potatoes and carrots and simmer 35 to 40 minutes until everything is tender.', 'Stir in the peas, cook 3 minutes and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1664741662725-bd131742b7b7', 'Laura Ohlman', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-food-y_7KLDoPlAc', true),
  ('berry-banana-yogurt-smoothies', 'Berry Banana Yogurt Smoothies', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian']::text[], 2, 5, false, 'Frozen berries and banana blended with yogurt and milk into a thick, filling smoothie.', array['Add the milk and yogurt to a blender first.', 'Add the bananas, frozen berries and honey.', 'Blend on high for 1 minute until completely smooth.', 'Pour into two glasses and serve right away.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570696516188-ade861b84a49', 'Denis', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/pink-smoothie-hsTwPUzFegQ', true),
  ('berry-yogurt-granola-parfaits', 'Berry Yogurt Granola Parfaits', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 2, 5, false, 'Thick Greek yogurt layered with mixed berries, crunchy granola, almonds and a drizzle of honey.', array['Thaw the berries in the microwave for 1 minute, or overnight in the fridge.', 'Spoon half of the yogurt into two glasses or bowls.', 'Layer on half of the berries and granola, then repeat with the rest.', 'Top with the almonds and drizzle with honey.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571230389215-b34a89739ef1', 'Tanaphong Toochinda', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/shallow-focus-photo-of-clear-drinking-glass-GbCEo-Nwyj4', true),
  ('black-bean-cheddar-enchiladas', 'Black Bean and Cheddar Enchiladas', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Corn tortillas rolled around black beans, corn and cheddar, baked under red enchilada sauce.', array['Heat the oven to 400°F.', 'Roughly mash the drained beans with the corn, onion, cumin, chili powder and half the cheddar.', 'Warm the tortillas in the microwave under a damp towel so they bend without cracking.', 'Spread a little sauce in a 9x13 dish, fill and roll the tortillas and set them seam side down.', 'Pour the remaining sauce over the top and cover with the rest of the cheddar.', 'Bake 20 minutes until bubbling, then top with yogurt and cilantro.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534352956036-cd81e27dd615', 'Alexandra Golovac', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/person-picking-pizza-xsfX3AqLDKo', true),
  ('black-bean-corn-quesadillas', 'Black Bean and Corn Quesadillas', 'lunch', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Crispy folded tortillas filled with melted cheddar, black beans and corn, with salsa for dipping.', array['Drain and rinse the beans, then mix them with the corn and cumin.', 'Cover half of each tortilla with cheddar and the bean mixture, then fold over.', 'Heat a little of the oil in a skillet over medium heat.', 'Cook the quesadillas two at a time, 2 to 3 minutes per side, until crisp and melted.', 'Cut into wedges and serve with the salsa.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584398572810-43c36faba2ad', 'David Holifield', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/brown-and-white-dish-on-white-ceramic-plate-hsLYgXwJQW0', true),
  ('black-bean-sweet-potato-tacos', 'Black Bean and Sweet Potato Tacos', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 35, false, 'Chili-roasted sweet potatoes and black beans in corn tortillas with avocado and lime.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the diced sweet potatoes with the oil, cumin, chili powder, smoked paprika and salt and roast 22 minutes, turning once.', 'Add the drained beans to the pan for the last 5 minutes to warm through.', 'Char the tortillas in a dry skillet or over a gas flame.', 'Fill with sweet potatoes and beans and top with red onion, avocado, feta, salsa and cilantro.', 'Serve with lime wedges.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299585323-38d6b0865b47', 'Chad Montano', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-tacos-lP5MCM6nZ5A', true),
  ('blackened-tilapia-chopped-salad', 'Blackened Tilapia Chopped Salad', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Spice-crusted tilapia seared in a hot skillet and served over a crunchy romaine, pepper and feta salad.', array['Mix the paprika, garlic powder, onion powder, thyme, cayenne, salt and pepper and coat the tilapia.', 'Sear the fish in 1 tablespoon of the olive oil 3 minutes per side until dark and flaky.', 'Chop the romaine, bell pepper and cucumber into a large bowl.', 'Dress the salad with the remaining olive oil and the lemon juice and add the feta.', 'Serve the fish on top of the salad.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1755632255314-2c8b14ff0226', 'David Todd McCarty', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/grilled-fish-atop-a-fresh-green-salad-VRJpZd8i2U4', true),
  ('broccoli-cheddar-cream-soup', 'Broccoli Cheddar Soup', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'keto']::text[], 4, 30, true, 'A thick, creamy broccoli soup finished with plenty of sharp cheddar.', array['Cook the onion in the butter over medium heat for 5 minutes, then add the garlic for 1 minute.', 'Add the chopped broccoli, broth, salt and pepper and simmer covered for 12 minutes until very tender.', 'Mash or blend about half the soup, leaving some broccoli pieces.', 'Stir in the cream and cream cheese over low heat until smooth.', 'Add the cheddar a handful at a time, stirring until melted, and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567953921490-6f671d196d1d', 'Denise Spijker', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/white-ceramic-bowl-BA6FzJZ9IfY', true),
  ('cajun-tilapia-seasoned-rice', 'Cajun Tilapia over Seasoned Rice', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'Spice-rubbed tilapia fillets seared in butter and served over paprika rice with fresh tomato and lemon.', array['Simmer the rice with 3 cups water, 1 teaspoon of the paprika and half the salt, covered, 18 minutes.', 'Mix the remaining paprika and salt with the garlic powder, onion powder, oregano, thyme and cayenne and coat the fish.', 'Sear the tilapia in the butter 3 to 4 minutes per side.', 'Fluff the rice and top with the fish.', 'Serve with sliced tomato and lemon wedges.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1661081090172-f91124f63c51', 'Design Wala', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-lDbGDnNe0CI', true),
  ('cauliflower-egg-fried-rice', 'Cauliflower Egg Fried Rice', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'keto']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Riced cauliflower stir-fried with scrambled eggs, mushrooms, carrot and green onion.', array['Scramble the eggs in 1 tablespoon of the oil in a large skillet, then set them aside.', 'Cook the mushrooms and carrot in the remaining oil over high heat for 5 minutes.', 'Add the garlic, ginger and frozen cauliflower rice and stir-fry 5 to 6 minutes until dry and tender.', 'Return the eggs to the pan with the soy sauce and sesame oil and toss.', 'Top with green onion.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1716551828295-566b835db769', 'Sarabjeet Singh', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-rice-and-chopsticks-on-a-white-table-skVf2YPxrco', true),
  ('cauliflower-mac-and-cheese-bake', 'Cauliflower Mac and Cheese Bake', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'keto']::text[], 4, 35, false, 'Tender cauliflower florets baked in a rich cheddar cream sauce with a golden parmesan top.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F and boil the cauliflower florets in salted water for 5 minutes, then drain very well.', 'Warm the cream and cream cheese in a saucepan over low heat, whisking until smooth.', 'Whisk in the mustard, garlic powder, salt, pepper and three quarters of the cheddar until melted.', 'Fold the cauliflower into the sauce and spread in a baking dish.', 'Top with the remaining cheddar, the parmesan and paprika.', 'Bake 15 minutes until bubbling and browned.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586032340622-a86b847e8bdb', 'micheile henderson', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-food-on-black-ceramic-plate-ECAkA9M4Rwo', true),
  ('cheesy-chicken-broccoli-bake', 'Cheesy Chicken Broccoli Bake', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Tender chicken and broccoli in a creamy garlic sauce, baked until the cheddar on top is golden and bubbling.', array['Heat the oven to 400°F.', 'Cut the chicken into bite-size pieces and brown in a skillet 5 to 6 minutes.', 'Stir the cream cheese, sour cream, broth, garlic powder, onion powder, salt and pepper until smooth.', 'Combine the chicken, broccoli, sauce and half the cheddar in a baking dish.', 'Top with the remaining cheddar and bake 20 minutes until bubbling.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1768204039572-9e62db7b39fd', 'Lee Milo', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/broccoli-and-cheese-gratin-in-a-white-dish-rShpgs9ThwI', true),
  ('cheesy-chicken-broccoli-penne-bake', 'Cheesy Chicken and Broccoli Penne Bake', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, true, 'Penne, chicken and broccoli baked in a homemade cheddar sauce under a crisp breadcrumb topping.', array['Heat the oven to 400°F and boil the penne 2 minutes less than the package says, adding the broccoli for the last minute, then drain.', 'Cook the diced chicken in half the butter in a large oven-safe skillet for 6 minutes, then set it aside.', 'Melt the remaining butter, stir in the garlic and flour for 1 minute, then whisk in the milk and simmer until thick.', 'Stir in most of the cheddar, the salt and pepper, then fold in the pasta, broccoli and chicken.', 'Top with the remaining cheddar and the breadcrumbs.', 'Bake 15 minutes until golden and bubbling.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584359246645-de78f6f10850', 'Louis Hansel', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/person-in-white-and-red-plaid-shirt-standing-beside-stainless-steel-tray-DSld8czZ0Ns', true),
  ('cheesy-tuna-cauliflower-casserole', 'Cheesy Tuna Cauliflower Casserole', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Classic tuna casserole comfort with cauliflower instead of noodles, baked under a cheddar and parmesan crust.', array['Heat the oven to 400°F and boil the cauliflower florets 5 minutes, then drain well.', 'Stir the cream cheese, sour cream, mustard, garlic powder, salt and pepper together.', 'Fold in the drained tuna, celery, cauliflower and 1 cup of the cheddar.', 'Spread in a baking dish and top with the remaining cheddar and the parmesan.', 'Bake 20 minutes until bubbling and golden.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1654780105295-9227206f11ec', 'David Trinks', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-casserole-dish-sitting-on-a-stove-top-UN1mx680neg', true),
  ('chicken-black-bean-burrito-bowls', 'Chicken & Black Bean Burrito Bowls', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'Taco-spiced chicken over rice with black beans, corn, peppers and salsa: a burrito you eat with a fork.', array['Simmer the rice with 3 cups water, covered, 18 minutes.', 'Coat the chicken with the taco seasoning and cook in the olive oil 5 to 6 minutes per side, then slice.', 'Saute the bell pepper 4 minutes and warm the beans and corn.', 'Divide the rice among bowls and top with the chicken, beans, corn and pepper.', 'Finish with salsa, sour cream, jalapeno and lime.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1668665771757-4d42737d295a', 'Andrew Relf', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-iku1zhSNRU8', true),
  ('chicken-burrito-cauliflower-rice-skillet', 'Chicken Burrito Cauliflower Rice Skillet', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'Taco-seasoned chicken thighs with peppers, salsa and cauliflower rice under melted cheddar, all in one pan.', array['Cut the chicken into small pieces and toss with the taco seasoning.', 'Brown the chicken in the oil 6 to 8 minutes.', 'Add the onion and bell pepper and cook 4 minutes.', 'Stir in the cauliflower rice and salsa and cook 5 minutes until tender.', 'Sprinkle with cheddar, cover and let it melt.', 'Finish with cilantro and lime wedges.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1665332111329-dd9d7fa46c74', 'Keesha''s Kitchen', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-food-9VKY7SXjHXE', true),
  ('chicken-caesar-salad-no-croutons', 'Chicken Caesar Salad, No Croutons', 'lunch', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Seared sliced chicken over crisp romaine with parmesan and a quick creamy Caesar dressing.', array['Season the chicken with the garlic powder, salt and pepper.', 'Heat the olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat and cook the chicken 6 minutes per side, until cooked through; rest 5 minutes and slice.', 'Whisk the mayonnaise, lemon juice, grated garlic, mustard, Worcestershire and half of the parmesan into a dressing.', 'Chop the romaine and toss it with the dressing.', 'Top with the chicken and the remaining parmesan.', 'To pack ahead, keep the dressing separate.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1676300186659-030de568e39a', 'Orkun Orcan', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-white-bowl-filled-with-lettuce-and-chicken-x-YS_Z_YPns', true),
  ('chicken-cauliflower-fried-rice', 'Chicken Cauliflower Fried Rice', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Golden cauliflower rice stir-fried with chicken, scrambled egg and green onion, ready faster than takeout.', array['Cut the chicken into bite-size pieces and season with salt and turmeric.', 'Stir-fry the chicken in the vegetable oil 6 to 7 minutes until cooked through, then set aside.', 'Scramble the eggs in the same pan and break them into small pieces.', 'Add the garlic, carrot and cauliflower rice and cook 5 minutes.', 'Return the chicken, add the soy sauce and sesame oil and toss.', 'Top with green onions.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1679735386220-e8888925676e', 'Alex Bayev', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-with-chopsticks-next-to-it-7oER79aCOys', true),
  ('chicken-tortilla-soup-with-black-beans', 'Chicken Tortilla Soup with Black Beans', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 35, true, 'Brothy tomato-chili soup with shredded chicken, black beans and corn, topped with crushed tortilla chips.', array['Heat the oil in a large pot and cook the onion for 4 minutes, then add the garlic, cumin and chili powder.', 'Add the broth, diced tomatoes and whole chicken breasts and simmer, covered, for 15 minutes.', 'Lift out the chicken, shred it with two forks and return it to the pot.', 'Stir in the black beans, corn and salt and simmer 5 minutes.', 'Finish with the lime juice and serve topped with crushed tortilla chips and cilantro.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1730409261374-6f8a89051fd2', 'Jason Leung', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-soup-on-a-table-next-to-a-glass-of-water-7uGYxSRguGQ', true),
  ('chicken-vegetable-stir-fry-with-rice', 'Chicken and Vegetable Stir-Fry with Rice', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Sliced chicken breast and frozen stir-fry vegetables in a garlic-ginger soy glaze over rice.', array['Cook the rice according to the package directions.', 'Whisk the soy sauce, honey, cornstarch and 1/4 cup water in a small bowl.', 'Heat half the oil in a large skillet over high heat and cook the chicken for 5 to 6 minutes until browned, then set it aside.', 'Add the remaining oil and the frozen vegetables and stir-fry 5 minutes.', 'Add the garlic and ginger, return the chicken and pour in the sauce.', 'Cook 2 minutes until glossy, then finish with the sesame oil and serve over the rice.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1783196736260-dd788dff4132', 'Alexandra Dobrin', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/delicious-stir-fried-chicken-and-vegetables-with-rice-HU64ydv7xhA', true),
  ('chickpea-spinach-coconut-curry', 'Chickpea Spinach Coconut Curry', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Chickpeas and spinach in a mild coconut tomato curry, spooned over white rice.', array['Start the rice in 3 cups of water, covered, for 18 minutes.', 'Cook the onion in the oil over medium heat for 4 minutes, then add the garlic, ginger and curry powder for 1 minute.', 'Add the tomatoes, coconut milk, drained chickpeas and salt and simmer 10 minutes.', 'Stir in the spinach until wilted.', 'Serve the curry over the rice.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609595781576-1580ff3ee291', 'Álvaro Bernal', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-food-on-white-ceramic-plate-ReySmTMcKEQ', true),
  ('cinnamon-french-toast', 'Cinnamon French Toast', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 15, false, 'Bread soaked in cinnamon-vanilla custard, griddled golden in butter and served with maple syrup.', array['Whisk the eggs, milk, cinnamon and vanilla together in a shallow dish.', 'Melt half of the butter in a large skillet over medium heat.', 'Dip four slices of bread in the custard, letting each side soak a few seconds.', 'Cook 2 to 3 minutes per side, until golden brown.', 'Repeat with the remaining butter and bread.', 'Serve with maple syrup.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631707928780-153b053e09aa', 'montatip lilitsanong', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-grilled-cheese-sandwich-on-a-plate-with-a-fork-4NQrFtFBIaI', true),
  ('classic-beef-and-bean-chili', 'Classic Beef and Bean Chili', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 60, true, 'Thick ground beef chili with kidney and pinto beans, tomatoes and warm chili spices, topped with cheddar.', array['Brown the ground beef with the onion and bell pepper in a large pot for 8 minutes, then drain the fat.', 'Stir in the garlic, chili powder, cumin, oregano and salt and cook 1 minute.', 'Add the diced tomatoes, tomato sauce, broth and drained beans.', 'Bring to a boil, then simmer partly covered for 40 minutes, stirring now and then.', 'Serve topped with the cheddar.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1729450412050-6c00ec592e34', 'Maria Klichik', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-chili-next-to-other-bowls-of-food-72oTVZs_730', true),
  ('classic-meatloaf-with-mashed-potatoes', 'Classic Meatloaf with Mashed Potatoes', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 70, true, 'Ketchup-glazed beef meatloaf with buttery mashed potatoes and peas.', array['Heat the oven to 375°F.', 'Mix the ground beef with the breadcrumbs, egg, 1/4 cup of the milk, onion, garlic, Worcestershire, half the ketchup and 1 teaspoon salt.', 'Shape into a loaf on a lined sheet pan and brush with the remaining ketchup mixed with the brown sugar.', 'Bake 50 minutes until the center reaches 160°F, then rest 10 minutes.', 'Meanwhile, boil the potatoes for 15 minutes, drain and mash with the butter, remaining milk, salt and pepper.', 'Warm the peas and serve with the sliced meatloaf and mashed potatoes.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1705945021699-7374c3fd34cb', 'Martinet Sinan', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-loaf-of-meatloaf-on-a-cutting-board-with-a-sprig-of-u0gs_AzC9CQ', true),
  ('classic-tuna-salad-sandwiches', 'Classic Tuna Salad Sandwiches', 'lunch', array['high_protein']::text[], 2, 10, false, 'Creamy tuna salad with crunchy celery and lemon on whole wheat bread with crisp lettuce.', array['Drain the tuna well and flake it into a bowl.', 'Stir in the mayonnaise, finely diced celery, lemon juice, salt and pepper.', 'Pile onto two slices of bread and top with lettuce leaves.', 'Close the sandwiches and cut in half.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558985250-27a406d64cb3', 'Youjeen Cho', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sandwich-on-table-sBKLiRiunK0', true),
  ('cottage-cheese-baked-penne', 'Cottage Cheese Baked Penne', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, true, 'Penne baked with marinara, spinach and a creamy cottage cheese layer under melted mozzarella.', array['Heat the oven to 400°F and boil the penne 2 minutes short of the package time, then drain.', 'Squeeze the thawed spinach dry and stir it into the cottage cheese with the egg, garlic, Italian seasoning, salt, pepper and half the mozzarella.', 'Toss the penne with the marinara and spread half in a 9x13 baking dish.', 'Spoon the cottage cheese mixture over the pasta and cover with the rest of the penne.', 'Top with the remaining mozzarella and the parmesan.', 'Bake 20 to 25 minutes until bubbling and golden, then rest 5 minutes before serving.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522784081430-8ac6a122cbc8', 'Jonathan Pielmayer', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/bake-mac-on-brown-ceramic-bowl-beside-fork-and-knife-RKJElwIyCQw', true),
  ('creamy-broccoli-cheddar-soup', 'Creamy Broccoli Cheddar Soup', 'lunch', array['vegetarian', 'keto']::text[], 4, 25, true, 'A thick, cheesy broccoli soup made with frozen florets and no flour; reheats well for lunches.', array['Melt the butter in a large pot over medium heat and cook the diced onion 4 minutes.', 'Add the minced garlic for 30 seconds, then the broth and broccoli.', 'Bring to a boil and simmer 8 minutes, until the broccoli is very tender.', 'Mash with a potato masher, or blend briefly, leaving some texture.', 'Stir in the cream, then the cheddar a handful at a time over low heat until melted.', 'Season with the salt and pepper.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578859318509-62790b079366', 'Samee Anderson', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/bowl-of-vegetable-soup-x4l4U-pHF9s', true),
  ('creamy-lemon-garlic-chicken-skillet', 'Creamy Lemon Garlic Chicken Skillet', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'Pan-seared chicken breasts simmered in a lemon, garlic and parmesan cream sauce, served with steamed broccoli.', array['Season the chicken with Italian seasoning, salt and pepper.', 'Sear in the olive oil and butter 5 to 6 minutes per side, then set aside.', 'Cook the garlic 30 seconds, then add the broth, cream and juice of half the lemon.', 'Simmer 4 minutes, stir in the parmesan and return the chicken with the remaining lemon, sliced.', 'Steam the broccoli and serve it alongside with the sauce spooned over.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586530844517-791ce35ad21d', 'Eiliv Aceron', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-food-on-black-ceramic-plate-ashL5eH-osc', true),
  ('creamy-tomato-tortellini-soup', 'Creamy Tomato Tortellini Soup', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Cheese tortellini and spinach in a creamy tomato broth, ready in one pot.', array['Cook the onion in the oil over medium heat for 4 minutes, then add the garlic and Italian seasoning for 1 minute.', 'Add the crushed tomatoes and broth and bring to a simmer.', 'Add the tortellini and cook 5 to 7 minutes until tender.', 'Stir in the cream and spinach until the spinach wilts.', 'Serve with parmesan.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1746632794965-cf4b75fd5f92', 'Carlos Davila Cepeda', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-soup-is-topped-with-cheese-C2iYbHL9PRQ', true),
  ('crustless-spinach-feta-quiche', 'Crustless Spinach Feta Quiche', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian', 'keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, true, 'An easy no-crust quiche with spinach, feta and mozzarella that slices and reheats well all week.', array['Heat the oven to 375°F and butter a 9-inch pie dish.', 'Thaw the spinach and squeeze it very dry in a clean towel.', 'Whisk the eggs, cream, salt and pepper together in a large bowl.', 'Stir in the spinach, diced onion, feta and mozzarella.', 'Pour into the dish and bake 30 to 35 minutes, until set in the center and golden.', 'Cool 5 minutes, then cut into wedges.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1636044990861-a540e33f9c5f', 'nrd', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-white-plate-topped-with-a-quiche-next-to-a-cup-of-coffee-RVPjkE7gKZo', true),
  ('curried-lentil-dal-with-rice', 'Curried Lentil Dal with Rice', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Lentils simmered soft with tomatoes, ginger and curry spices, served over rice with cool yogurt.', array['Cook the onion in the oil over medium heat for 5 minutes, then stir in the garlic, ginger, curry powder, cumin and turmeric for 1 minute.', 'Add the rinsed lentils, tomatoes, broth, 3 cups of water and the salt.', 'Simmer partly covered for 25 to 30 minutes, stirring now and then, until the lentils are soft and thick.', 'Meanwhile cook the rice in 3 cups of water, covered, for 18 minutes.', 'Mash some of the lentils against the pot to thicken the dal.', 'Serve over rice with a spoonful of yogurt and chopped cilantro.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1714062105923-5cb2a3a07499', 'Joanna Stołowicz', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-table-topped-with-bowls-filled-with-different-types-of-food-QfuQ2qGMDmI', true),
  ('deli-style-egg-salad-sandwiches', 'Deli-Style Egg Salad Sandwiches', 'lunch', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Chopped hard-boiled eggs in a creamy mustard dressing with celery, on whole wheat bread.', array['Cover the eggs with water in a pot, bring to a boil, then cover, turn off the heat and let stand 11 minutes.', 'Cool the eggs under cold water, peel and chop.', 'Mix with the mayonnaise, mustard, diced celery, sliced green onions, paprika, salt and pepper.', 'Spread onto four slices of bread, add lettuce and top with the remaining bread.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1733105658196-44b3c597bb41', 'Tadahiro Higuchi', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-white-plate-topped-with-a-slice-of-cake-next-to-a-bowl-of-salad-TYvO1gGKyYQ', true),
  ('fluffy-pancakes-with-maple-syrup', 'Fluffy Pancakes with Maple Syrup', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 20, true, 'Tall from-scratch pancakes made with pantry staples; extras freeze well for toaster mornings.', array['Whisk the flour, baking powder, sugar and salt together in a large bowl.', 'Melt the butter. Whisk the milk, egg and 2 tablespoons of the melted butter together.', 'Stir the wet mixture into the dry until just combined; a few lumps are fine.', 'Heat a skillet over medium heat and brush it with some of the remaining butter.', 'Pour in 1/4 cup of batter per pancake and cook 2 minutes, until bubbles pop on top.', 'Flip and cook 1 to 2 minutes more, until golden.', 'Serve stacked with maple syrup.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620108091863-55147620ddaf', 'Anna Zaro', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/brown-cookies-on-white-ceramic-plate-9qpXI_mujpk', true),
  ('garlic-butter-shrimp-mushroom-skillet', 'Garlic Butter Shrimp & Mushroom Skillet', 'dinner', array['keto']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Shrimp, mushrooms and zucchini sauteed in garlic butter with lemon and a pinch of red pepper.', array['Saute the mushrooms and zucchini in the olive oil 5 to 6 minutes until browned.', 'Push the vegetables aside and melt the butter with the garlic and pepper flakes.', 'Add the shrimp and cook 2 minutes per side until pink.', 'Toss everything with the lemon juice and salt.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1659951226926-a75791782250', 'Durenne Loris', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-pan-of-food-aEHCeaGSgKA', true),
  ('garlic-herb-drumsticks-green-beans', 'Garlic Herb Drumsticks with Green Beans', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, false, 'Crispy oven-roasted drumsticks rubbed with garlic, paprika and herbs, with buttery lemon green beans.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the drumsticks with the olive oil, garlic powder, paprika, Italian seasoning, salt and pepper.', 'Roast on a sheet pan 35 to 40 minutes, turning once, until crisp and cooked through.', 'Simmer the green beans 5 minutes, drain, then toss with the butter, garlic and lemon juice.', 'Serve the drumsticks with the green beans.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588767768106-1b20e51d9d68', 'Ekaterina Novitskaya', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/fried-chicken-on-clear-glass-plate-jMKxaakIKfQ', true),
  ('ginger-beef-broccoli-stir-fry', 'Ginger Beef & Broccoli Stir-Fry', 'dinner', array['keto']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Seared sirloin with broccoli, green beans and bell pepper in a garlic, ginger and soy sauce; no rice required.', array['Cut the steak into bite-size pieces and toss with 1 tablespoon of the soy sauce.', 'Sear the beef in the vegetable oil over high heat 2 to 3 minutes, then set aside.', 'Stir-fry the broccoli, green beans and bell pepper with a splash of water 5 minutes.', 'Add the garlic and ginger and cook 30 seconds.', 'Return the beef with the remaining soy sauce and the sesame oil and toss.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1760504526069-ff0f8bf6e4ca', 'Davis Dai', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/beef-and-broccoli-stir-fry-with-vegetables-on-a-red-plate-qKPKDb4_W24', true),
  ('greek-chickpea-salad', 'Greek Chickpea Salad', 'lunch', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 15, true, 'Chickpeas tossed with cucumber, tomato, red onion and feta in a lemon-oregano dressing.', array['Drain and rinse the chickpeas.', 'Dice the cucumber and tomatoes and thinly slice the red onion.', 'Whisk the olive oil, lemon juice, oregano, salt and pepper together in a large bowl.', 'Add the chickpeas, vegetables and feta and toss well.', 'Serve now, or refrigerate up to 4 days.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1688923130941-889a41f4439c', 'Imad 786', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-food-with-a-spoon-in-it-nFkC9zJv0pk', true),
  ('greek-chickpea-salad-pitas', 'Greek Chickpea Salad with Warm Pita', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 15, false, 'Chickpeas, cucumber, tomatoes and feta in a lemon oregano dressing over romaine with warm pita.', array['Whisk the oil, lemon juice, oregano, salt and pepper in a large bowl.', 'Add the drained chickpeas, cucumber, halved tomatoes and red onion and toss.', 'Fold in the feta.', 'Warm the pitas in a dry skillet or toaster and cut into wedges.', 'Serve the salad over chopped romaine with the pita.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568803776598-57e3cf2f90fc', 'dimitri.photography', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sliced-vegetable-dish-JDP_yzauSYg', true),
  ('greek-yogurt-alfredo-penne-peas', 'Greek Yogurt Alfredo Penne with Peas', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Penne and peas in a creamy garlic parmesan sauce made with Greek yogurt instead of cream.', array['Boil the penne until al dente, adding the peas for the last 2 minutes.', 'Save a cup of the pasta water, then drain.', 'Melt the butter in the empty pot over low heat and cook the garlic for 1 minute.', 'Take the pot off the heat and whisk in the yogurt, milk, parmesan, salt and pepper.', 'Add the pasta and peas and toss, loosening with pasta water until the sauce coats the penne.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1625128726788-3fee36746aaa', 'Bakd&Raw by Karolin Baitinger', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sliced-cucumber-on-white-ceramic-plate-4MX7xLAiWBc', true),
  ('grilled-cheese-with-tomato-soup', 'Grilled Cheese with Tomato Soup', 'lunch', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Buttery griddled cheese sandwiches with a quick creamy tomato soup for dunking.', array['Heat the olive oil in a pot over medium heat and cook the diced onion 4 minutes; add the minced garlic for 30 seconds.', 'Add the crushed tomatoes, broth, Italian seasoning, salt and pepper and simmer 10 minutes.', 'Blend the soup until smooth and stir in the cream.', 'Butter one side of each bread slice and sandwich two slices of cheese between each pair, butter side out.', 'Cook the sandwiches in a skillet over medium-low heat 3 minutes per side, until golden and melted.', 'Cut in half and serve with the soup.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1762647420988-5080acf33988', 'David Trinks', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/tomato-soup-with-grilled-cheese-sandwich-kF2DHADo9Bo', true),
  ('ground-beef-tacos-with-lime-cabbage-slaw', 'Ground Beef Tacos with Lime Cabbage Slaw', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Seasoned ground beef in warm corn tortillas, topped with a crunchy lime cabbage slaw, cheddar and salsa.', array['Brown the ground beef in a large skillet over medium-high heat for 6 to 8 minutes, then drain the fat.', 'Stir in the taco seasoning and 1/2 cup water and simmer 3 minutes.', 'Toss the shredded cabbage with the lime juice, chopped cilantro and salt.', 'Warm the tortillas in a dry skillet, about 20 seconds per side.', 'Fill each tortilla with beef, slaw, cheddar and salsa.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1690874684451-92358e91b14c', 'Max Griss', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/three-tacos-on-a-plate-with-limes-and-cilantro-ZAW0C46XvSo', true),
  ('ground-turkey-egg-roll-bowls', 'Ground Turkey Egg Roll Bowls', 'lunch', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, true, 'All the flavor of an egg roll without the wrapper: turkey and cabbage stir-fried with ginger, garlic and soy.', array['Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat and brown the turkey 6 minutes, breaking it up.', 'Stir in the minced garlic and ginger for 1 minute.', 'Add the coleslaw mix and soy sauce and cook 4 minutes, tossing, until the cabbage is tender-crisp.', 'Stir in the sesame oil and most of the sliced green onions.', 'Divide among four containers, top with the remaining green onions and a drizzle of sriracha.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1630409350018-0e06ea178b92', 'Mario Raj', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/vegetable-salad-on-white-ceramic-plate-UhwdAcjk_zo', true),
  ('ground-turkey-teriyaki-rice-bowls', 'Ground Turkey Teriyaki Rice Bowls', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Ground turkey, broccoli and carrots in a homemade honey-soy teriyaki sauce over rice.', array['Cook the rice according to the package directions.', 'Whisk the soy sauce, honey, rice vinegar, cornstarch, ground ginger and 1/3 cup water.', 'Heat the oil in a large skillet and brown the turkey for 6 minutes, breaking it up.', 'Add the garlic, carrots and broccoli, cover and cook 5 minutes.', 'Pour in the sauce and simmer 2 minutes until thick and glossy.', 'Spoon over the rice and top with green onions.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1791386804677-815379da3e2e', 'Travis Palma', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/teriyaki-chicken-bowl-with-rice-vtTqQJ0hfZc', true),
  ('ham-cheddar-egg-muffin-cups', 'Ham and Cheddar Egg Muffin Cups', 'breakfast', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, true, 'Baked egg cups with ham, cheddar and bell pepper: twelve from one muffin tin for the week.', array['Heat the oven to 375°F and grease a 12-cup muffin tin with the butter.', 'Dice the ham and bell pepper and slice the green onions; divide among the cups with the cheddar.', 'Beat the eggs with the salt and pepper and pour evenly into the cups.', 'Bake 18 to 20 minutes, until puffed and set.', 'Cool 5 minutes and lift out. Refrigerate up to 4 days and reheat 30 seconds in the microwave.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518310532637-f5225f94f3c3', 'Kaitlyn Chow', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/grilled-patties-with-tomato-toppings-tIElrLKqdjo', true),
  ('homestyle-chicken-noodle-soup', 'Homestyle Chicken Noodle Soup', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Chicken thighs simmered with carrots, celery and onion in broth, finished with egg noodles and parsley.', array['Melt the butter in a large pot and cook the onion, carrots and celery for 5 minutes.', 'Add the garlic, thyme, broth and chicken thighs and simmer, covered, for 15 minutes.', 'Lift out the chicken, shred it with two forks and return it to the pot.', 'Add the egg noodles and cook 6 to 8 minutes until tender.', 'Season with the salt and pepper and stir in the parsley.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612966948332-81d747414a8f', 'Karolina Kołodziejczak', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/soup-in-white-ceramic-bowl--m0du_taY4g', true),
  ('honey-garlic-chicken-thighs-with-rice', 'Honey Garlic Chicken Thighs with Rice', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Seared chicken thighs glazed in honey, garlic and soy sauce, served with rice and steamed broccoli.', array['Cook the rice according to the package directions.', 'Season the chicken with the salt and pepper and sear in the oil over medium-high heat for 5 to 6 minutes per side.', 'Stir together the honey, soy sauce, vinegar and garlic and pour it over the chicken.', 'Simmer 3 to 4 minutes, turning the chicken, until the glaze is sticky.', 'Steam or microwave the broccoli until tender.', 'Serve the chicken over the rice with the broccoli and spoon over the extra glaze.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583579366395-c0a857d2182a', 'Markus Winkler', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-food-on-white-ceramic-plate-8U3MxqPEmJI', true),
  ('honey-garlic-salmon-rice-broccoli', 'Honey Garlic Salmon with Rice & Broccoli', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Pan-seared salmon glazed with honey, garlic and soy, served with fluffy white rice and steamed broccoli.', array['Simmer the rice with 3 cups water, covered, 18 minutes.', 'Sear the salmon in the oil 4 minutes per side.', 'Add the honey, soy sauce and garlic to the pan and spoon over the fish 1 to 2 minutes until glossy.', 'Steam the broccoli florets 4 to 5 minutes.', 'Serve the salmon with the rice and broccoli and drizzle with the glaze.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1675209705883-7aec595f5aa8', 'Camara Negra', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-black-plate-topped-with-salmon-and-broccoli-RZV1-tNbHy4', true),
  ('hummus-veggie-pita-pockets', 'Hummus Veggie Pita Pockets', 'lunch', array['vegetarian']::text[], 2, 10, false, 'Warm pita halves spread with hummus and stuffed with spinach, cucumber, tomato, carrot and feta.', array['Cut the pitas in half and open the pockets.', 'Spread hummus inside each half.', 'Slice the cucumber and tomato and shred the carrot.', 'Stuff the pockets with the spinach, vegetables and feta.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534352211968-8d25dbe0e951', 'Alexandra Golovac', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/vegetable-sandwich-MAbhhj3QCXQ', true),
  ('italian-sausage-and-pepper-penne', 'Italian Sausage and Pepper Penne', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Penne with browned Italian sausage, sweet bell peppers and onion in a garlicky tomato sauce.', array['Boil the penne in salted water until al dente, then drain, saving 1/2 cup of the pasta water.', 'Heat the oil in a large skillet and brown the sausage for 6 minutes, breaking it up.', 'Add the peppers and onion and cook 5 minutes until soft.', 'Stir in the garlic, Italian seasoning and diced tomatoes and simmer 5 minutes.', 'Toss in the penne with a splash of pasta water and top with parmesan.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621996346565-e3dbc646d9a9', 'Ben Lei', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/penne-pasta-with-meat-sauce-flFd8L7_B3g', true),
  ('italian-sausage-zucchini-pepper-skillet', 'Italian Sausage, Zucchini & Pepper Skillet', 'dinner', array['keto']::text[], 4, 30, true, 'Browned Italian sausage with zucchini, bell peppers and onion in one skillet; it reheats well for lunches.', array['Slice the sausage into thick coins and brown in the olive oil 6 to 8 minutes.', 'Add the onion and bell peppers and cook 5 minutes.', 'Add the zucchini, garlic, Italian seasoning and pepper flakes.', 'Cook 6 to 8 minutes until the vegetables are tender and the sausage is cooked through.', 'Sprinkle with parmesan.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1698843813577-db28459556b0', 'Elena Leya', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-pan-filled-with-food-sitting-on-top-of-a-table-H-D-0UOgzMc', true),
  ('italian-veggie-pasta-salad', 'Italian Veggie Pasta Salad', 'lunch', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 20, true, 'Penne tossed with tomatoes, cucumber, bell pepper and mozzarella in a tangy Italian vinaigrette.', array['Cook the penne in salted boiling water according to the package directions.', 'Drain and rinse under cold water until cool.', 'Whisk the olive oil, vinegar, Italian seasoning, garlic powder, salt and pepper together in a large bowl.', 'Halve the tomatoes, dice the cucumber and bell pepper and thinly slice the red onion.', 'Toss the pasta, vegetables, mozzarella and parmesan with the dressing.', 'Serve now, or refrigerate up to 4 days.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1630492782892-74f99406dc59', 'engin akyurt', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/pasta-dish-on-white-ceramic-bowl-X4QCAodTlh0', true),
  ('lemon-chicken-thigh-potato-bake', 'Lemon Chicken Thigh & Potato Bake', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, false, 'Chicken thighs roasted in one dish with potatoes, cherry tomatoes, garlic, oregano and lemon slices.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the potato chunks, tomatoes and garlic with half the olive oil, half the oregano and half the salt in a baking dish.', 'Rub the chicken with the remaining oil, oregano and salt and nestle it on top.', 'Add the lemon slices and roast 35 minutes until the chicken is cooked through and the potatoes are tender.', 'Scatter with chopped parsley.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1680098021573-b9402ee336ec', 'Babs Gorniak', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/two-bowls-of-food-with-lemons-meat-and-vegetables-xgDsiUC5p-w', true),
  ('lemon-garlic-tuna-pasta', 'Lemon Garlic Tuna Pasta', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Pantry pasta with canned tuna, peas, garlic, lemon and parmesan that comes together while the water boils.', array['Boil the pasta until tender, adding the peas for the last 2 minutes, and save a splash of the water.', 'Warm the olive oil with the garlic and pepper flakes in the empty pot 1 minute.', 'Add the drained tuna, pasta, peas, lemon juice and pasta water and toss.', 'Stir in the parmesan, salt and green onions.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1666724283327-a9cd945fd5c5', 'Danielle Townsend', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-qzyzPxeKiRA', true),
  ('lemony-lentil-vegetable-soup', 'Lemony Lentil Vegetable Soup', 'lunch', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'A thick lentil soup with carrots, celery and tomatoes, brightened with lemon; reheats well all week.', array['Dice the onion, carrots and celery and mince the garlic.', 'Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat and cook the vegetables 6 minutes, until softened.', 'Stir in the garlic and cumin for 30 seconds.', 'Add the lentils, tomatoes, broth, 2 cups of water, salt and pepper and bring to a boil.', 'Simmer partly covered 25 minutes, until the lentils are tender.', 'Stir in the lemon juice and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552298013-de2af4b94854', 'Steve Tsang', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/soup-in-maroon-ceramic-pot-MP_A0OK_O60', true),
  ('lentil-bolognese-spaghetti', 'Lentil Bolognese with Spaghetti', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, true, 'A thick tomato and lentil ragu with carrot and celery, tossed with spaghetti and parmesan.', array['Cook the onion, carrot and celery in the oil over medium heat for 6 minutes.', 'Stir in the garlic, tomato paste and Italian seasoning for 1 minute.', 'Add the lentils, crushed tomatoes, broth, salt and pepper and simmer covered for 30 minutes until the lentils are tender.', 'Boil the spaghetti until al dente and drain, saving a cup of the water.', 'Toss the spaghetti with the sauce, loosening with pasta water as needed.', 'Serve with parmesan.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562370345-d64b69d8f824', 'Paula Hayes', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-pasta-SbLAg_zzDuI', true),
  ('lettuce-wrap-cheeseburgers', 'Lettuce-Wrap Cheeseburgers', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Juicy skillet cheeseburgers wrapped in crisp lettuce with tomato, onion and a quick burger sauce.', array['Mix the beef with the garlic powder, salt and pepper and shape into 4 patties.', 'Cook the patties in a hot skillet 4 minutes per side.', 'Top each patty with a cheese slice and cover 1 minute to melt.', 'Stir the mayo and mustard together for the sauce.', 'Wrap each burger in large lettuce leaves with tomato, onion and sauce.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1764018601476-e5fac1f27893', 'Barcello''s fusion', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-lettuce-wrapped-burger-with-tomato-and-onion-rMs9zl7Ckuc', true),
  ('meal-prep-chicken-burrito-bowls', 'Meal-Prep Chicken Burrito Bowls', 'lunch', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, true, 'Taco-seasoned chicken thighs over rice with black beans, corn, salsa and cheddar, packed for four lunches.', array['Cook the rice according to the package directions.', 'Cut the chicken into bite-size pieces and toss with the taco seasoning.', 'Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat and cook the chicken 8 minutes, until browned and cooked through.', 'Warm the drained beans and the corn together in the microwave 2 minutes.', 'Divide the rice among four containers and top with the chicken, beans, corn, salsa and cheddar.', 'Squeeze lime over the top. Refrigerate up to 4 days.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1668665771757-4d42737d295a', 'Andrew Relf', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-iku1zhSNRU8', true),
  ('mushroom-spinach-cheddar-omelets', 'Mushroom Spinach Cheddar Omelets', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian', 'keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 2, 15, false, 'Three-egg omelets folded around sauteed mushrooms, wilted spinach and melted cheddar.', array['Melt half of the butter in a nonstick skillet over medium-high heat and cook the mushrooms 4 minutes, until browned.', 'Add the spinach and stir until wilted, then move the vegetables to a plate.', 'Beat the eggs with the salt and pepper.', 'Melt half of the remaining butter over medium heat, pour in half of the eggs and cook 2 minutes, lifting the edges, until just set.', 'Fill with half of the vegetables and cheddar, fold over and slide onto a plate.', 'Repeat for the second omelet.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677844592730-ce9c936d8f1a', 'Bakd&Raw by Karolin Baitinger', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-white-plate-topped-with-an-omelet-and-greens-SCZP5rvZINk', true),
  ('mushroom-stroganoff-egg-noodles', 'Mushroom Stroganoff with Egg Noodles', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'Browned mushrooms in a creamy sour cream sauce over buttered egg noodles.', array['Boil the egg noodles until tender and drain.', 'Brown the mushrooms in the butter over medium-high heat for 8 minutes, then add the onion and cook 4 minutes.', 'Stir in the garlic, paprika and thyme for 1 minute, then the flour.', 'Add the broth, soy sauce and mustard and simmer 5 minutes until thickened.', 'Take off the heat and stir in the sour cream, salt and pepper.', 'Serve over the noodles with parsley.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611608927216-ca294fa86bee', 'Vladimir Gladkov', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/pasta-dish-on-white-ceramic-plate-ioXOnu-furc', true),
  ('one-pan-chicken-thighs-and-rice-with-peas', 'One-Pan Chicken Thighs and Rice with Peas', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, false, 'Paprika chicken thighs cooked on top of garlicky rice in one pan, finished with sweet peas.', array['Season the chicken with the paprika, thyme, salt and pepper.', 'Heat the oil in a large deep skillet and sear the chicken 3 minutes per side, then set it aside.', 'Melt the butter in the same pan and cook the onion 4 minutes, then stir in the garlic and rice.', 'Pour in the broth, bring to a boil and nestle the chicken on top.', 'Cover and simmer on low for 18 to 20 minutes until the rice is tender.', 'Scatter over the peas, cover 3 minutes and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577110633798-8d4439305952', 'Faris Mohammed', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/frying-pan-of-chicken-O8OZsmNWSsg', true),
  ('one-pot-beef-penne-skillet', 'One-Pot Beef & Penne Skillet', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Penne cooked right in a ground beef and tomato sauce, then finished with melted mozzarella and parmesan.', array['Brown the beef with the onion in a deep skillet, then stir in the garlic and Italian seasoning.', 'Add the crushed tomatoes, broth, salt and dry penne.', 'Cover and simmer 12 to 14 minutes, stirring twice, until the pasta is tender.', 'Stir in the mozzarella and top with the parmesan.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1630151318557-1b2b20cc8cff', 'Konstantinas Ladauskas', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/pasta-dish-on-white-ceramic-bowl-OCccmmmZxhU', true),
  ('one-pot-turkey-taco-rice', 'One-Pot Turkey Taco Rice', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'Ground turkey, rice, black beans and corn simmered in salsa and taco seasoning, finished with melted cheddar.', array['Brown the turkey with the onion in a large deep skillet for 6 minutes.', 'Stir in the taco seasoning, rice, salsa, broth, black beans and corn.', 'Bring to a boil, then cover and simmer on low for 18 minutes until the rice is tender.', 'Sprinkle with the cheddar, cover 2 minutes to melt and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512058533999-106ee01bf777', 'Annie Spratt', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/black-frying-pan-with-food-on-top-x-R8jcm2ors', true),
  ('pan-seared-pork-chops-buttered-cabbage', 'Pan-Seared Pork Chops with Buttered Cabbage', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Paprika-rubbed pork chops seared until golden and served over cabbage wilted in butter, garlic and a splash of vinegar.', array['Rub the chops with the smoked paprika, garlic powder, thyme, salt and pepper.', 'Sear in the olive oil 4 to 5 minutes per side, then rest on a plate.', 'Melt the butter in the same pan and cook the onion 2 minutes.', 'Add the cabbage and garlic and cook 6 to 8 minutes until tender, then stir in the vinegar.', 'Serve the chops over the cabbage.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612871689527-2a6145cc9e86', 'Junior REIS', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/fried-food-on-white-ceramic-plate-G3giNPjjB18', true),
  ('parmesan-crusted-cod-green-beans', 'Parmesan-Crusted Cod with Green Beans', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Cod fillets baked under a golden parmesan crust next to garlicky roasted green beans.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the green beans with the olive oil, half the garlic powder and half the salt on a sheet pan and roast 8 minutes.', 'Spread the mayo over the cod and press on the parmesan mixed with the paprika and remaining garlic powder.', 'Add the cod to the pan and bake 12 minutes until golden and flaky.', 'Serve with lemon wedges.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595936126366-6e85b4812ca2', 'Edward Howell', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/fried-fish-with-green-vegetable-on-white-ceramic-bowl-mvlWXqxjaJ4', true),
  ('peanut-butter-banana-oatmeal', 'Peanut Butter Banana Oatmeal', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian']::text[], 2, 10, false, 'Creamy stovetop oats cooked in milk, topped with sliced banana and a spoonful of peanut butter.', array['Bring the milk, 1 cup of water and the salt to a simmer in a small pot.', 'Stir in the oats and cinnamon and cook 5 minutes, stirring often, until thick and creamy.', 'Divide between two bowls.', 'Top with sliced banana and a spoonful of peanut butter.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599450307683-16b29464da5c', 'Lucie Rangel', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/red-strawberries-on-white-ceramic-plate-vdvzWVw6YKw', true),
  ('peanut-noodles-cabbage-carrots', 'Peanut Noodles with Cabbage and Carrots', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Spaghetti tossed with crunchy cabbage and carrots in a creamy peanut, soy and lime sauce.', array['Boil the spaghetti until tender, adding the coleslaw mix for the last minute, then drain.', 'Whisk the peanut butter, soy sauce, vinegar, honey, sesame oil, sriracha, garlic, ginger and 1/3 cup hot water until smooth.', 'Toss the noodles and cabbage with the sauce.', 'Top with green onion and chopped peanuts and serve with lime wedges.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609690963718-0b55905aef78', 'Melissia Ohol', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sliced-vegetables-in-white-ceramic-bowl-o77dNRrgcn0', true),
  ('peanut-tofu-broccoli-rice-bowls', 'Peanut Tofu and Broccoli Rice Bowls', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'Crisp pan-fried tofu and broccoli over rice with a quick peanut-soy sauce.', array['Cook the rice in 3 cups of water, covered, for 18 minutes.', 'Press the tofu dry, cut it into cubes and toss with the cornstarch.', 'Fry the tofu in the oil over medium-high heat for 8 to 10 minutes, turning, until golden, then set aside.', 'Add the broccoli florets and a splash of water to the pan, cover and steam 4 minutes.', 'Whisk the peanut butter, soy sauce, honey, vinegar, sriracha, garlic, ginger and 1/4 cup hot water until smooth.', 'Return the tofu to the pan, pour in the sauce and toss for 1 minute.', 'Serve over rice topped with chopped peanuts and green onion.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631255325918-1ca2886508a5', 'Bakd&Raw by Karolin Baitinger', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-food-on-white-ceramic-plate-LBJZDJvStJc', true),
  ('pinto-bean-huevos-rancheros', 'Pinto Bean Huevos Rancheros', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Fried eggs on crisp corn tortillas with mashed pinto beans, warm salsa, cheddar and avocado.', array['Mash the drained beans in a small pot with the cumin and a splash of water and keep warm.', 'Warm the salsa in a small saucepan.', 'Fry the tortillas in a little oil for 30 seconds per side until just crisp.', 'Fry the eggs in the remaining oil to your liking.', 'Spread beans on each tortilla and top with an egg, salsa, cheddar, avocado and cilantro.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1650330151304-5db3ca9b3b6c', 'Alexandra Mendívil', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-food-with-an-egg-avocado-and-rice-rNriCVGMVgQ', true),
  ('pinto-bean-taco-salad', 'Crunchy Pinto Bean Taco Salad', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 15, false, 'Romaine piled with seasoned pinto beans, corn, tomato, cheddar, avocado and crushed tortilla chips.', array['Warm the drained beans with the taco seasoning and a splash of water for 3 minutes.', 'Stir the salsa, sour cream and lime juice together for the dressing.', 'Divide the chopped romaine among 4 bowls.', 'Top with the beans, corn, tomato, cheddar and avocado.', 'Spoon over the dressing and finish with crushed tortilla chips.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543339127-b02a6d983980', 'Hermes Rivera', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/fruit-dish-on-plate-dZuHkZwryyI', true),
  ('pork-egg-roll-bowls-with-rice', 'Pork Egg Roll Bowls with Rice', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Ground pork stir-fried with coleslaw mix, garlic, ginger and soy sauce, served over white rice.', array['Cook the rice according to the package directions.', 'Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat and brown the pork for 6 minutes, breaking it up.', 'Add the garlic and ginger and cook 30 seconds.', 'Add the coleslaw mix, soy sauce and rice vinegar and stir-fry 4 minutes until the cabbage is just tender.', 'Stir in the sesame oil and green onions.', 'Serve over the rice with sriracha on the side.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1745123129024-d97c4b71ed4d', 'Kouji Tsuru', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/meat-and-vegetables-served-with-rice-EgIB9a8B6UU', true),
  ('pork-egg-roll-in-a-bowl', 'Pork Egg Roll in a Bowl', 'dinner', array['keto']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Everything inside an egg roll, minus the wrapper: ground pork and cabbage stir-fried with ginger, garlic and soy.', array['Brown the pork in a large skillet over medium-high heat, breaking it up.', 'Stir in the garlic, ginger and carrot and cook 1 minute.', 'Add the coleslaw mix, soy sauce and rice vinegar and toss 4 to 5 minutes until just tender.', 'Drizzle with sesame oil and sriracha.', 'Top with sliced green onions and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1597130869926-224e85944619', 'ABHISHEK HAJARE', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/green-and-brown-vegetable-salad-6XcZ2NQmRqY', true),
  ('pork-tenderloin-sweet-potato-skillet', 'Pork Tenderloin & Sweet Potato Skillet', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 35, false, 'Strips of smoky pork tenderloin tossed with caramelized sweet potato cubes and red onion.', array['Cook the sweet potato cubes in half the olive oil, covered, 12 minutes, stirring, until tender and browned.', 'Slice the pork into thin strips and toss with the smoked paprika, cumin, thyme, salt and pepper.', 'Move the sweet potatoes to a plate and sear the pork in the remaining oil 5 to 6 minutes.', 'Add the garlic and half the red onion and cook 1 minute.', 'Return the sweet potatoes, add the vinegar and toss.', 'Top with the remaining sliced red onion.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1636407715708-a097fdcef57a', 'Nico M.', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-on-a-wooden-table-yicKRIphU1c', true),
  ('potato-pea-curry-with-naan', 'Potato and Pea Curry with Naan', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 40, false, 'Potatoes and peas simmered in a spiced tomato sauce and scooped up with warm naan.', array['Cook the onion in the oil over medium heat for 5 minutes, then stir in the garlic, ginger, curry powder, cumin and turmeric for 1 minute.', 'Add the potatoes, tomatoes, broth and salt.', 'Cover and simmer 20 minutes until the potatoes are tender.', 'Stir in the peas and cook 3 minutes, mashing a few potatoes to thicken the sauce.', 'Warm the naan and serve with the curry and cilantro.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789990642036-e10c2df4fc81', 'Zoshua Colah', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/poori-and-potato-curry-breakfast-LBknd0DOoRk', true),
  ('potato-pepper-breakfast-hash-with-eggs', 'Potato Pepper Breakfast Hash with Eggs', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'Crispy skillet potatoes with bell pepper and onion, finished with eggs cooked right in the pan.', array['Dice the potatoes into 1/2-inch cubes; dice the pepper and onion.', 'Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat and cook the potatoes 12 minutes, stirring now and then, until golden.', 'Add the pepper, onion, smoked paprika, garlic powder, salt and pepper and cook 5 minutes.', 'Make four wells in the hash and crack an egg into each.', 'Cover and cook over medium-low heat 4 to 5 minutes, until the whites are set.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601579112521-5d6badb0bf3c', 'Megan Bucknall', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/black-round-plate-with-cooked-food-hzxxLzqaEjU', true),
  ('red-beans-and-rice-with-smoked-sausage', 'Red Beans and Rice with Smoked Sausage', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 45, true, 'Creamy simmered kidney beans with smoked sausage, onion, bell pepper and celery over white rice.', array['Heat the oil in a large pot and brown the sliced sausage for 4 minutes.', 'Add the onion, bell pepper and celery and cook 6 minutes, then stir in the garlic, smoked paprika, thyme and cayenne.', 'Add the kidney beans with their liquid, the broth and salt.', 'Simmer uncovered for 25 minutes, mashing some of the beans against the pot to thicken.', 'Meanwhile, cook the rice according to the package directions.', 'Serve the beans over the rice.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1686699782036-e101b4f5a02e', 'Ronald Vargas', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bowl-of-food-on-a-wooden-table-4NxCbpyh8AY', true),
  ('refried-bean-corn-quesadillas', 'Refried Bean and Corn Quesadillas', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Crisp flour tortillas filled with refried beans, corn, green chiles and melted cheddar.', array['Stir the cumin, drained corn and green chiles into the refried beans.', 'Spread the bean mixture over half of each tortilla, top with cheddar and fold.', 'Cook in a lightly oiled skillet over medium heat for 2 to 3 minutes per side until crisp and melted.', 'Cut into wedges and serve with salsa and sour cream.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617990590988-895fe6cbabda', 'Lottie Griffiths', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sliced-pizza-on-brown-wooden-table-FRObR62TyKk', true),
  ('roast-chicken-with-potatoes-and-carrots', 'Roast Chicken with Potatoes and Carrots', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 90, true, 'A whole chicken rubbed with garlic thyme butter and roasted over potatoes, carrots and onion.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the potatoes, carrots and onion with the oil and half the salt in a large roasting pan.', 'Mash the butter with the garlic, thyme, pepper and remaining salt and rub it all over the chicken.', 'Put the halved lemon inside the chicken and set it on top of the vegetables.', 'Roast 70 to 75 minutes until the thigh reaches 165°F.', 'Rest 10 minutes, then carve and serve with the vegetables and pan juices.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600575615458-5129e7cb960b', 'QUENTIN Mahe', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/roasted-chicken-on-white-ceramic-plate-exjZl4aydUc', true),
  ('rotisserie-chicken-black-bean-quesadillas', 'Rotisserie Chicken and Black Bean Quesadillas', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Crisp flour tortillas filled with shredded rotisserie chicken, black beans and melted cheddar.', array['Shred the chicken and toss it with the black beans and cumin.', 'Sprinkle cheddar over half of each tortilla, add the chicken mixture and fold closed.', 'Brush a large skillet with a little oil and cook the quesadillas over medium heat for 2 to 3 minutes per side until golden.', 'Cut into wedges and serve with salsa and sour cream.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618040996337-56904b7850b9', 'Lottie Griffiths', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sliced-pizza-on-brown-wooden-table-pvTgyioFSTY', true),
  ('rotisserie-chicken-enchiladas', 'Rotisserie Chicken Enchiladas', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Flour tortillas rolled around shredded chicken, green chiles and cheddar, baked in red enchilada sauce.', array['Heat the oven to 375°F.', 'Mix the shredded chicken with the onion, green chiles, cumin, sour cream and half the cheddar.', 'Spread half a can of enchilada sauce in a 9x13-inch baking dish.', 'Roll the filling in the tortillas and place them seam-side down in the dish.', 'Pour over the remaining sauce and top with the remaining cheddar.', 'Bake 20 minutes until bubbling.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1674135529596-cb1f707d231d', 'Aleksandra Gencheva', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-holding-a-dish-of-food-on-a-table-4vB9GNWnmbM', true),
  ('rotisserie-chicken-salad-lettuce-cups', 'Rotisserie Chicken Salad Lettuce Cups', 'lunch', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 15, true, 'Shredded rotisserie chicken in a creamy lemon-mustard dressing, scooped into crisp romaine leaves.', array['Pull the meat from the chicken, discard the skin and bones, and chop or shred it.', 'Stir the mayonnaise, mustard, lemon juice, salt and pepper together in a large bowl.', 'Fold in the chicken, diced celery and sliced green onions.', 'Separate the romaine leaves and spoon the chicken salad into them.', 'Keep leftover chicken salad in the fridge up to 4 days and fill the leaves just before eating.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612949060306-4c298ad7f34c', 'Christine Isakzhanova', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/vegetable-salad-on-white-ceramic-plate-xWcExN_8nTk', true),
  ('sausage-egg-cheese-breakfast-burritos', 'Sausage Egg and Cheese Breakfast Burritos', 'breakfast', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, true, 'Freezer-friendly burritos stuffed with sausage, hash browns, scrambled eggs, cheddar and salsa.', array['Brown the sausage in a large skillet over medium-high heat 5 minutes, breaking it up.', 'Add the hash browns and cook 5 minutes, until crisp at the edges.', 'Beat the eggs, pour them in and stir 2 minutes, until just set.', 'Warm the tortillas and divide the filling, cheddar and salsa among them.', 'Fold in the sides and roll up tightly.', 'Eat now, or wrap in foil and freeze; reheat unwrapped in the microwave 2 minutes.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662478839359-751ffc3cbbd8', 'Mikey Frost', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-bmXDqfPf4Vo', true),
  ('sausage-pepper-egg-scramble', 'Sausage and Pepper Egg Scramble', 'breakfast', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 2, 15, false, 'Breakfast sausage and bell pepper scrambled with eggs and finished with melted cheddar.', array['Brown the sausage in a skillet over medium-high heat 5 minutes, breaking it into crumbles.', 'Add the diced bell pepper and cook 3 minutes, until softened.', 'Beat the eggs with the salt and pepper, pour them in and stir gently 2 minutes, until just set.', 'Sprinkle with the cheddar, cover 1 minute to melt and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662751331020-8a30ce0c78f6', 'Andrijana Bozic', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-SBc3QKmqwpg', true),
  ('sheet-pan-chickpeas-vegetables-feta', 'Sheet-Pan Chickpeas and Vegetables', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Chickpeas, sweet potato, broccoli and peppers roasted on one pan and finished with feta and lemon.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the sweet potato, bell pepper, red onion, zucchini and drained chickpeas with the oil, smoked paprika, garlic powder, oregano and salt.', 'Spread over two sheet pans and roast 15 minutes.', 'Add the broccoli, toss and roast 12 to 15 minutes more until browned.', 'Squeeze the lemon over the pans and top with feta.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578071768923-b3d68573028e', 'Louis Hansel', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/broccoli-and-carrots-on-white-plate-bPNvATD1cvc', true),
  ('sheet-pan-drumsticks-potatoes-carrots', 'Sheet-Pan Drumsticks with Potatoes and Carrots', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, false, 'Paprika-rubbed chicken drumsticks roasted on one pan with crispy potatoes and sweet carrots.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the potatoes and carrots with half the oil and half the salt on a large sheet pan.', 'Rub the drumsticks with the remaining oil, paprika, garlic powder, onion powder, pepper and remaining salt.', 'Nestle the drumsticks among the vegetables.', 'Roast 35 to 40 minutes, turning once, until the chicken reaches 175°F and the potatoes are golden.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599161146640-8d60bd2888e3', 'Branimir Petakov', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/brown-bread-with-yellow-fruits-HB0IbmJyyI8', true),
  ('sheet-pan-lemon-salmon-broccoli', 'Sheet-Pan Lemon Salmon & Broccoli', 'dinner', array['keto']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Salmon fillets and broccoli roasted together on one pan with garlic, butter and lemon.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the broccoli florets with the olive oil, garlic, salt and pepper on a sheet pan and roast 8 minutes.', 'Add the salmon to the pan, dot with butter and top with lemon slices.', 'Roast 10 to 12 minutes until the salmon flakes easily.', 'Squeeze the remaining lemon over everything.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1627857638952-642f8cbba8da', 'Ben Libby', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/brown-bread-on-white-ceramic-plate-xJBeGxiSYBE', true),
  ('sheet-pan-paprika-drumsticks-potatoes', 'Sheet-Pan Paprika Drumsticks & Potatoes', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, false, 'Budget drumsticks and potato wedges roasted together in a smoky paprika and garlic rub until crisp.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Cut the potatoes into wedges.', 'Toss the drumsticks and potatoes with the olive oil, both paprikas, garlic powder, onion powder, salt and pepper.', 'Spread on a sheet pan and roast 40 minutes, turning once, until the chicken is crisp and cooked through.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1705088295364-6e98d62a3146', 'Gourmet Lenz', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-plate-of-food-that-includes-chicken-potatoes-and-coleslaw-zlob_4tPETs', true),
  ('sheet-pan-pork-tenderloin-sweet-potatoes', 'Sheet-Pan Pork Tenderloin with Sweet Potatoes', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, false, 'Honey-mustard pork tenderloin roasted on one pan with sweet potatoes and green beans.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F.', 'Toss the sweet potatoes with half the oil and half the salt on a sheet pan and roast 10 minutes.', 'Rub the pork with the mustard, honey, garlic powder, smoked paprika, pepper and remaining salt.', 'Toss the green beans with the remaining oil, then add the pork and beans to the pan.', 'Roast 20 minutes until the pork reaches 145°F.', 'Rest the pork 5 minutes, slice and serve with the vegetables.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606258868842-79eb9eff76af', 'Samuel Regan-Asante', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sliced-bread-on-blue-and-white-ceramic-plate-e3AA8nJMwTI', true),
  ('skillet-pork-chops-green-beans-potatoes', 'Skillet Pork Chops with Green Beans and Potatoes', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Pan-seared seasoned pork chops with garlic butter green beans and tender baby potatoes.', array['Boil the halved potatoes in salted water for 12 to 15 minutes until tender, adding the green beans for the last 4 minutes, then drain.', 'Season the pork chops with the paprika, garlic powder, salt and pepper.', 'Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat and sear the chops 4 to 5 minutes per side until they reach 145°F.', 'Rest the chops on a plate and melt the butter with the garlic in the same pan.', 'Toss the potatoes and green beans in the garlic butter and serve with the chops.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1703219342022-e3eb5c216c61', 'Hybrid Storytellers', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-close-up-of-a-plate-of-food-on-a-table-WlELSb2TEfU', true),
  ('skillet-shakshuka-with-feta', 'Skillet Shakshuka with Feta', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'keto']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Eggs poached in a smoky tomato and pepper sauce, finished with crumbled feta.', array['Cook the onion and bell pepper in the oil in a large skillet over medium heat for 6 minutes.', 'Stir in the garlic, tomato paste, cumin, smoked paprika and pepper flakes for 1 minute.', 'Add the tomatoes and salt and simmer 8 minutes until slightly thickened.', 'Make 8 wells in the sauce and crack an egg into each.', 'Cover and cook 5 to 7 minutes until the whites are set.', 'Top with feta and cilantro.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582492710145-d723e0a219f8', 'amirali mirhashemian', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/stainless-steel-bowl-with-food-K9oKpOebg84', true),
  ('sloppy-joes-with-quick-coleslaw', 'Sloppy Joes with Quick Coleslaw', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Saucy sweet-and-tangy ground beef piled on toasted buns with a fast creamy coleslaw.', array['Toss the coleslaw mix with the mayonnaise, vinegar and salt and chill while you cook.', 'Brown the ground beef with the onion and bell pepper in a large skillet for 7 minutes, then drain the fat.', 'Stir in the tomato sauce, ketchup, brown sugar, Worcestershire and mustard.', 'Simmer 6 to 8 minutes until thick.', 'Toast the buns, fill them with the beef and serve with the coleslaw.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1432752641289-a25fc853fceb', 'Brandon Morgan', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/burger-and-fries-on-bowl-fGYeKt1E6hc', true),
  ('slow-cooker-pulled-pork-sandwiches', 'Slow Cooker Pulled Pork Sandwiches', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 450, true, 'Pork shoulder slow-cooked until it shreds, tossed in BBQ sauce and piled on buns with creamy coleslaw.', array['Rub the pork with the brown sugar, smoked paprika, garlic powder and most of the salt.', 'Put the sliced onion in the slow cooker, set the pork on top and add half the vinegar and 1/2 cup water.', 'Cook on low for 7 hours until the pork falls apart.', 'Shred the pork with two forks, drain off most of the liquid and stir in the BBQ sauce.', 'Toss the coleslaw mix with the mayonnaise, remaining vinegar and a pinch of salt.', 'Pile the pork and coleslaw onto the buns.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1680404971036-33eaa1d2d840', 'Thomas Wavid Johns', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-pulled-pork-sandwich-with-a-side-of-tater-tots-L-2p59uIP1E', true),
  ('slow-cooker-pulled-pork-slaw-bowls', 'Slow-Cooker Pulled Pork Slaw Bowls', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 480, true, 'Spice-rubbed pork shoulder cooked low and slow, shredded and piled over tangy slaw and spinach.', array['Rub the pork with the smoked paprika, garlic powder, onion powder, cumin, salt and pepper.', 'Place in a slow cooker with the broth and 1 tablespoon of the vinegar and cook on low 8 hours.', 'Shred the pork with two forks and moisten with the cooking juices.', 'Toss the coleslaw mix with the mayo, mustard and remaining vinegar.', 'Divide the spinach and slaw among bowls and top with the pork.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622756144420-6877b1b7476e', 'Grooveland Designs', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-food-on-stainless-steel-bowl-8kkTIumkHxU', true),
  ('smoked-sausage-cabbage-potato-skillet', 'Smoked Sausage, Cabbage and Potato Skillet', 'dinner', '{}'::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Browned smoked sausage fried with tender cabbage, diced potatoes and onion in one skillet.', array['Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat and brown the sliced sausage for 4 minutes, then set it aside.', 'Add the butter and potatoes, cover and cook 8 minutes, stirring once or twice.', 'Add the onion, cabbage, garlic, salt and pepper and cook 8 minutes until the cabbage is tender and the potatoes are golden.', 'Return the sausage to the pan and stir in the mustard and vinegar.', 'Cook 1 more minute and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1592259695987-4aa79c3c34a6', 'Amr Taha™', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sliced-vegetables-on-brown-wooden-chopping-board-KtbmX7bBR-U', true),
  ('smoked-sausage-pepper-cabbage-skillet', 'Smoked Sausage, Pepper & Cabbage Skillet', 'dinner', array['keto']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Sliced smoked sausage fried with cabbage, onion and green pepper for a cheap, filling one-pan dinner.', array['Slice the sausage into coins and brown in a large skillet 4 to 5 minutes.', 'Add the butter, onion and bell pepper and cook 3 minutes.', 'Add the cabbage, garlic, smoked paprika and pepper.', 'Cook 8 to 10 minutes, stirring, until the cabbage is tender and browned at the edges.', 'Stir in the vinegar and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1726177974269-a03507107f71', 'Victor Birai', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-wooden-spoon-in-a-pot-of-food-Rc1iuBwnb0A', true),
  ('southwest-quinoa-black-bean-salad', 'Southwest Quinoa and Black Bean Salad', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 30, true, 'Quinoa tossed with black beans, corn, peppers and avocado in a cumin lime dressing.', array['Rinse the quinoa and simmer it in 2 cups of water, covered, for 15 minutes, then spread on a plate to cool.', 'Whisk the lime juice, oil, cumin, chili powder and salt in a large bowl.', 'Add the drained beans and corn, bell pepper, tomato and green onion.', 'Fold in the quinoa and cilantro.', 'Top with avocado just before serving.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505576633757-0ac1084af824', 'Mariana Medvedeva', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/plate-full-of-salad-with-spice-on-top-of-brown-board-fk6IiypMWss', true),
  ('spinach-feta-oven-frittata', 'Spinach and Feta Oven Frittata', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'A thick baked egg frittata packed with spinach, cottage cheese, feta and cheddar.', array['Heat the oven to 400°F.', 'Cook the onion in the butter and oil in a 12-inch oven-safe skillet for 4 minutes, then add the garlic and spinach and stir until wilted.', 'Whisk the eggs with the cottage cheese, cheddar, salt and pepper.', 'Pour the eggs over the spinach, stir once and scatter the feta on top.', 'Cook 2 minutes on the stove, then bake 14 to 16 minutes until set and puffed.', 'Rest 5 minutes and cut into wedges.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1607877200978-3cab430e00cd', 'Carlos Perales', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/sliced-pizza-with-red-sauce-on-white-ceramic-plate-aIfV9vtoHn4', true),
  ('strawberry-cottage-cheese-granola-bowls', 'Strawberry Cottage Cheese Granola Bowls', 'breakfast', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 2, 5, false, 'Protein-packed cottage cheese topped with sliced strawberries, crunchy granola and a drizzle of honey.', array['Hull and slice the strawberries.', 'Divide the cottage cheese between two bowls.', 'Top with the strawberries and granola and drizzle with the honey.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614630536994-a6b781d56e15', 'Olena Bohovyk', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/strawberry-and-blackberry-on-white-ceramic-bowl-odLdpSRRZtQ', true),
  ('three-bean-vegetarian-chili', 'Three-Bean Vegetarian Chili', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 50, true, 'A thick meatless chili with black, kidney and pinto beans, corn and peppers, topped with cheddar.', array['Cook the onion and bell pepper in the oil over medium heat for 6 minutes.', 'Stir in the garlic, chili powder, cumin and smoked paprika for 1 minute.', 'Add the crushed and diced tomatoes, the drained beans, broth and salt.', 'Simmer partly covered for 30 minutes, stirring now and then.', 'Stir in the corn and cook 5 minutes more.', 'Serve topped with cheddar.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591266798549-32fa7cd32f45', 'micheile henderson', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/red-and-green-chili-peppers-in-white-ceramic-bowl-FhMB8pMge5U', true),
  ('tofu-egg-roll-bowls', 'Tofu Egg Roll in a Bowl', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'keto']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Crumbled tofu, cabbage and scrambled egg stir-fried with ginger, garlic and soy sauce.', array['Press the tofu dry and crumble it into bite-size pieces.', 'Brown the tofu in the vegetable oil over high heat for 6 minutes, then push it to one side.', 'Scramble the eggs in the empty side of the pan and break them up.', 'Add the garlic, ginger and coleslaw mix and stir-fry 3 to 4 minutes until the cabbage just wilts.', 'Stir in the soy sauce, vinegar and sesame oil.', 'Serve topped with green onion and a drizzle of sriracha.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1788536442033-abf6a485fef7', 'Zoshua Colah', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/tofu-salad-bowl-for-lunch-vAQ8bEmdKTk', true),
  ('tofu-scramble-black-bean-burritos', 'Tofu Scramble Black Bean Burritos', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Spiced scrambled tofu, black beans, peppers and cheddar rolled into warm flour tortillas.', array['Drain the tofu, pat it dry and crumble it with your hands.', 'Cook the onion and bell pepper in the oil over medium-high heat for 4 minutes.', 'Add the tofu, cumin, chili powder, turmeric and salt and cook 6 minutes, stirring, until dry and lightly browned.', 'Stir in the drained beans and heat through.', 'Warm the tortillas, fill with the scramble, cheddar and salsa, and roll up.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566740933430-b5e70b06d2d5', 'Creative Headline', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-food-F10nTHkCiW8', true),
  ('tuna-egg-salad-stuffed-avocados', 'Tuna Egg Salad Stuffed Avocados', 'lunch', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 2, 20, false, 'Avocado halves filled with a lemony tuna and hard-boiled egg salad.', array['Cover the eggs with water in a small pot, bring to a boil, then cover, turn off the heat and let stand 11 minutes.', 'Cool the eggs under cold water, peel and chop.', 'Drain the tuna and mix with the eggs, mayonnaise, diced celery, lemon juice, salt and pepper.', 'Halve and pit the avocados.', 'Spoon the salad into and over the avocado halves.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1715611935696-a59ebf388252', 'Elena Leya', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-white-plate-topped-with-two-stuffed-avocados-O7p7LgVC5KA', true),
  ('tuna-noodle-casserole-with-peas', 'Tuna Noodle Casserole with Peas', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Egg noodles, canned tuna and peas in a creamy cheddar sauce, baked with a crunchy breadcrumb top.', array['Heat the oven to 400°F and boil the egg noodles 2 minutes less than the package says, then drain.', 'Melt the butter in a large pot and cook the onion for 4 minutes.', 'Stir in the flour for 1 minute, then whisk in the milk and simmer until thick.', 'Stir in the cheddar, salt and pepper, then fold in the noodles, drained tuna and peas.', 'Spread in a 2-quart baking dish and top with the breadcrumbs.', 'Bake 18 minutes until bubbling and golden.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611098876665-5384d4e39a1e', 'Brigitta Baranyi', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/rice-with-sliced-tomato-and-green-vegetable-in-clear-plastic-container-bCO7CphRIpM', true),
  ('turkey-and-spinach-lasagna', 'Turkey and Spinach Lasagna', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 75, true, 'Layers of noodles, ground turkey marinara, spinach, cottage cheese and melted mozzarella.', array['Heat the oven to 375°F and boil the lasagna noodles until just pliable, then drain.', 'Brown the turkey with the garlic and Italian seasoning for 6 minutes, then stir in the marinara.', 'Mix the cottage cheese with the egg, parmesan, salt and the thawed, squeezed-dry spinach.', 'Layer sauce, noodles, cottage cheese mixture and mozzarella in a 9-inch square baking dish, three times, ending with mozzarella.', 'Cover with foil and bake 30 minutes, then uncover and bake 15 minutes more.', 'Rest 10 minutes before slicing.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1625555897305-136548cc968c', 'Stefen Tan', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/brown-bread-on-white-ceramic-plate-8-r-1CZUcbA', true),
  ('turkey-bolognese-zucchini-noodles', 'Turkey Bolognese Zucchini Noodles', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 30, false, 'A hearty ground turkey and tomato sauce spooned over tender zucchini noodles with plenty of parmesan.', array['Cut the zucchini into long thin noodles with a spiralizer or vegetable peeler.', 'Brown the turkey in the olive oil with the garlic.', 'Stir in the crushed tomatoes, tomato paste, Italian seasoning and salt and simmer 12 minutes.', 'Saute the zucchini noodles in a second pan 2 to 3 minutes until just tender.', 'Top the noodles with the sauce and parmesan.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1671225548130-7ed32615ff3e', 'Sergi Ferrete', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-wooden-bowl-filled-with-pasta-and-vegetables-qdizmyoK3ig', true),
  ('turkey-cheddar-lettuce-roll-ups', 'Turkey and Cheddar Lettuce Roll-Ups', 'lunch', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 2, 10, false, 'No-cook, no-bread roll-ups of deli turkey and cheese in romaine leaves, with cucumber sticks.', array['Separate the romaine into eight large leaves.', 'Stir the mayonnaise and mustard together and spread a little down each leaf.', 'Layer on the turkey and half a slice of cheese, then roll up tightly.', 'Cut the cucumber into sticks and pack alongside.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622620283268-5cf46da1df39', 'Alexandra Tran', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/green-vegetable-on-red-ceramic-bowl-sVl2DJ4P9G8', true),
  ('turkey-taco-salad-bowls', 'Turkey Taco Salad Bowls', 'dinner', array['keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 20, false, 'Taco-seasoned ground turkey over crisp romaine with tomato, cheddar, avocado, salsa and sour cream; no chips needed.', array['Brown the turkey in a skillet, breaking it up, 7 to 8 minutes.', 'Stir in the taco seasoning and a splash of water and simmer 2 minutes.', 'Chop the romaine and divide among 4 bowls.', 'Top with the turkey, tomato, cheddar and avocado.', 'Finish with salsa and sour cream.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1707080019893-bf8fc3d55f08', 'Caroline Ross', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-white-bowl-filled-with-lettuce-and-meat-D1u7ibM8vKU', true),
  ('turkey-two-bean-chili', 'Turkey & Two-Bean Chili', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 45, true, 'A big pot of ground turkey chili with kidney and black beans, peppers and tomatoes; better the next day.', array['Brown the turkey with the onion and bell pepper in the olive oil.', 'Stir in the garlic, chili powder, cumin and salt and cook 1 minute.', 'Add the diced tomatoes, tomato sauce, broth and drained beans.', 'Simmer 25 minutes, stirring now and then.', 'Taste, adjust the seasoning and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576020956260-490f5c5fc892', 'Brooke Lark', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/cooked-viand-on-white-container-kFYjbRnklo4', true),
  ('two-bean-minestrone-soup', 'Two-Bean Minestrone Soup', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 45, true, 'A big pot of vegetable soup with cabbage, zucchini, beans and elbow pasta in tomato broth.', array['Cook the onion, carrot and celery in the oil over medium heat for 6 minutes.', 'Add the garlic and Italian seasoning for 1 minute.', 'Add the tomatoes, broth, cabbage, zucchini and salt and simmer 15 minutes.', 'Stir in the drained beans and the pasta and cook 8 to 10 minutes until the pasta is tender.', 'Thin with a little water if needed and serve with parmesan.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603105037880-880cd4edfb0d', 'Victoria Shes', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/stainless-steel-spoon-on-white-ceramic-bowl-90Z4qIxWc8Y', true),
  ('unstuffed-cabbage-roll-skillet', 'Unstuffed Cabbage Roll Skillet', 'dinner', array['keto']::text[], 4, 35, true, 'All the flavor of cabbage rolls without the rolling: ground beef and chopped cabbage simmered in tomato sauce.', array['Brown the beef with the onion in the olive oil, then stir in the garlic and paprika.', 'Add the chopped cabbage, diced tomatoes, tomato sauce, broth, salt and pepper.', 'Cover and simmer 20 minutes, stirring now and then, until the cabbage is tender.', 'Taste, adjust the seasoning and serve in bowls.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1743148601298-655e3d10303e', 'András Gal', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/delicious-stew-simmers-in-a-large-pot-UkwpejZLgGI', true),
  ('vegetable-egg-fried-rice', 'Vegetable Egg Fried Rice', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Rice stir-fried with scrambled eggs, frozen mixed vegetables, garlic and soy sauce.', array['Cook the rice in 2 3/4 cups of water, covered, for 16 minutes, then spread it on a tray to steam dry (or use leftover rice).', 'Scramble the eggs in half the vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok and set aside.', 'Stir-fry the frozen vegetables and garlic in the remaining oil over high heat for 3 minutes.', 'Add the rice and fry 4 minutes, pressing out any clumps.', 'Stir in the eggs, soy sauce, sesame oil and green onion and serve.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1788603907381-018a23c26c81', 'Zoshua Colah', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/fried-rice-with-vegetables-Mrr4elxhksk', true),
  ('veggie-ramen-stir-fry-eggs', 'Veggie Ramen Stir-Fry with Eggs', 'dinner', array['vegetarian']::text[], 4, 15, false, 'Ramen noodles tossed with stir-fry vegetables, scrambled eggs and a garlic soy sauce.', array['Boil the ramen noodles for 2 minutes (leave out the seasoning packets) and drain.', 'Scramble the eggs in half the vegetable oil in a large skillet and set aside.', 'Stir-fry the frozen vegetables, garlic and ginger in the remaining oil over high heat for 5 minutes.', 'Mix the soy sauce, brown sugar, sriracha and sesame oil.', 'Add the noodles, eggs and sauce to the pan and toss 1 to 2 minutes.', 'Top with green onion.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553621043-f607bfbf6640', 'Riccardo Bergamini', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/pasta-on-plate-Xe14NrSK9io', true),
  ('weeknight-chicken-tikka-masala-rice', 'Weeknight Chicken Tikka Masala with Rice', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 40, true, 'Chicken simmered in a creamy spiced tomato sauce from pantry staples, served over white rice.', array['Simmer the rice with 3 cups water, covered, 18 minutes.', 'Toss the diced chicken with the yogurt, half the curry powder and the salt.', 'Brown the chicken in the butter 6 minutes, then add the onion, garlic and ginger and cook 3 minutes.', 'Stir in the remaining curry powder, cumin, paprika, tomato sauce and tomato paste and simmer 12 minutes.', 'Stir in the cream and heat through.', 'Serve over the rice.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1788462613018-40916ff6415c', 'gabbiistudios', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/chicken-tikka-masala-dinner-plate-7ZGOtqVZtAk', true),
  ('weeknight-spaghetti-with-meat-sauce', 'Weeknight Spaghetti with Meat Sauce', 'dinner', array['high_protein']::text[], 4, 25, false, 'Spaghetti tossed in a quick ground beef and marinara sauce with onion, garlic and parmesan.', array['Boil the spaghetti in salted water until al dente, then drain.', 'Meanwhile, heat the oil in a large skillet and cook the onion for 4 minutes.', 'Add the ground beef and garlic and brown for 6 to 8 minutes, then drain the fat.', 'Stir in the marinara and Italian seasoning and simmer 8 minutes.', 'Toss the spaghetti with the sauce and top with parmesan.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622973536968-3ead9e780960', 'Homescreenify', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/spaghetti-on-white-ceramic-plate-sA3wymYqyaI', true),
  ('zucchini-cottage-cheese-lasagna', 'Zucchini and Cottage Cheese Lasagna', 'dinner', array['vegetarian', 'keto', 'high_protein']::text[], 4, 60, true, 'Roasted zucchini planks stand in for noodles, layered with cottage cheese, marinara and mozzarella.', array['Heat the oven to 425°F, slice the zucchini lengthwise into 1/4-inch planks, salt them and roast on two sheet pans for 12 minutes.', 'Blot the zucchini dry with paper towels and lower the oven to 375°F.', 'Mix the cottage cheese with the egg, garlic, Italian seasoning, half the parmesan and half the mozzarella.', 'Layer a little marinara, zucchini, cottage cheese mixture and more marinara in an 8x8 dish, repeating twice.', 'Top with the remaining mozzarella and parmesan.', 'Bake 30 minutes until browned, then rest 10 minutes before slicing.']::text[], 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1632229095740-8c75082087c5', 'Moira Nazzari', 'https://unsplash.com/photos/a-dish-of-food-on-a-wooden-table-Y9iaZNbUHtQ', true)
